cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Cusp catastrophe dynamics in wearable electrodermal recordings: research artefact"
abstract: >-
  Derivation, estimator, Monte Carlo validation suite and manuscript for a
  cusp-catastrophe model of sensory and executive overload. Includes the
  identifiability study bounding what cusp geometry can be recovered from
  wearable-length recordings, and a ground-truth demonstration that standard
  rolling-window early-warning indicators return exponents of the wrong sign.
type: software
